BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Kidical Mass TO
DTSTART:20260926T124500Z
DTEND:20260926T150000Z
DTSTAMP:20260923T101546Z
UID:9043e442-d64f-59df-a0a4-0089e4fdeafe
DESCRIPTION:Kidical Mass TO returns! Back-to-school marks the perfect oppo
 rtunity to get on our bikes. We hope that this iteration of Kidical Mass T
 O will empower you to bike to school this season!\n\nKidical Mass is an in
 ternational movement for child- and cycling-friendly cities. These rides a
 re an all-ages\, all-abilities celebration of cycling that highlights the 
 need for healthier\, safer streets.\n\nWhen: Meet at 8:45 AM\, depart at 9
  AM\nWhere: Start and End at Lithuania Park (155 Oakmount Rd\, Toronto\, O
 N M6P 2M3)\nWhat: ~4.5 km family-friendly ride along multi-use paths\, qui
 et streets\, and dedicated cycling infrastructure\, supported by Cycle Tor
 onto ride guides\nRoute: https://ridewithgps.com/routes/52801976\nURL: htt
 ps://www.cycleto.ca/kidical_mass_20260926
LOCATION:Lithuania Park\n155 Oakmount Rd\nToronto ON M6P 2M3\nCA
URL:https://www.cycleto.ca/kidical_mass_20260926
END:VEVENT
